MakeOrder_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
└── when market allowlisted
   ├── when caller is not the offer maker
   │  └── it should revert with NotOfferMaker
   ├── when ratifier is not the setter ratifier
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidRatifier
   ├── when callback is not empty
   │  └── it should revert with CallbackNotEmpty
   ├── when size caps are not exactly one nonzero
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidOfferCaps
   ├── when buy offer has non zero seller receiver
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidReceiver
   ├── when sell offer receiver is not the vault
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidReceiver
   ├── when sell offer is not reduce only
   │  └── it should revert with NotReduceOnly
   ├── when sell offer caps by assets
   │  └── it should revert with SellCapMustBeUnits
   ├── when sell offer tick below floor
   │  └── it should revert with TickBelowFloor
   └── when offer is valid
      ├── it should ratify the single leaf root
      ├── it should return root equal to hashOffer
      └── it should emit OrderMade
